		<h1>Pressure Washer Nozzle Selection Guide</h1>
		<div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="card">
                    <span class="bold h4">Also see</span>
                    <ul class="list-unstyled">
                        <li><a href="trouble-shooting">Pressure Washer Trouble Shooting</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                
            </div>
			<div class="col-md-8 order-first">
				<p>
					Use the chart below to help with pressure washer spray tip / nozzle selection.
					You will need to know how many gallons per minute your pressure washer puts out as well
					as the maximum PSI rating.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="col-sm-12">
				<h4>Nozzle / Tip Size Selection Chart</h4>
				<p>
					Determine the proper nozzle size by the pressure washer&#8217;s GPM (Gallons
					Per Minute) at a specific PSI . <b>
						If the nozzle size is too small,
						your equipment can be damaged
					</b>. If the nozzle size is to large, your cleaning ability
					will be reduced. Please note that nozzle fan degree does not effect nozzle size selection.
				</p>
			</div>
